Implemented `run` in [app/service.py](/workspace/app/service.py:1).

It now:
- preserves copied reads;
- prepares revision-stamped decisions only when the row remains valid;
- atomically revalidates and commits decisions;
- allows independent-row commits concurrently;
- returns `conflict` for stale, invalid, or malformed commits.

Direct public-scenario checks passed.

Implemented `run` in [app/service.py](/workspace/app/service.py).

It now:
- prepares versioned decisions when the group invariant permits;
- commits independent-group decisions concurrently;
- returns `'conflict'` for stale, invalid, or invariant-breaking commits;
- retains read behavior and unknown-operation errors.

Verified both public checks pass and the module compiles.

Implemented `run` in [app/service.py](/workspace/app/service.py).

It now:
- preserves deep-copy reads;
- prepares versioned decisions only when the record-level invariant holds;
- permits independent records to commit concurrently;
- rejects stale or invalid commits with `'conflict'`;
- returns `'committed'` for valid commits.

Verified both supplied public checks pass via `python3` (pytest is not installed).

Implemented `run` in [app/service.py](/workspace/app/service.py).

It now supports versioned prepare/commit decisions:
- concurrent commits to different records succeed;
- stale same-record commits return `'conflict'`;
- reads remain deep copies;
- invariant-preserving checks occur before prepare and commit.

Public checks and syntax compilation pass.
